 "summary": "No duplication found: the one-loop solution, its Landau log-scale and the uniqueness half have no counterpart in EpsilonEridani, Mathlib, Physlib/PhyslibAlpha or TauCeti (QCD.oneLoopAlphaS is a regularised total proxy that solves no ODE, and Mathlib has no uniqueness API for IsIntegralCurveOn outside the manifold setting). The PR also removes existing duplication by factoring SmallX's ball-Lipschitz uniqueness into a shared lemma and rederiving not_exists_global_solution_sq from the new theorem.",
